Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: adapt epoch cadence after normal-score batch
 finalization

Keep ordinary Avalanche finalization thresholds for every mempool batch.
Use poll RTT and conflict/miss feedback to adapt epoch scheduling, and
pipeline the next epoch after clean normal-score finalization. A confidence
increment is not a stake-weighted supermajority certificate.

